[TITLE]
;;Project Title/Notes
Flow regulators under dynamic wave, constant inflows, SI units - noodl test fixture
J2 -> J3 a side orifice (passes from its weir regime to its orifice regime as J2 fills);
J4 -> J5 a transverse weir with end contractions; J7 -> J4 a V-notch weir;
J8 (a 3 m2 storage unit) -> Out2 an outlet with a RATING curve (TABULAR/DEPTH) into an outfall

[OPTIONS]
;;Option             Value
FLOW_UNITS           CMS
INFILTRATION         HORTON
FLOW_ROUTING         DYNWAVE
LINK_OFFSETS         DEPTH
MIN_SLOPE            0
ALLOW_PONDING        NO
SKIP_STEADY_STATE    NO

START_DATE           01/01/2026
START_TIME           00:00:00
REPORT_START_DATE    01/01/2026
